# Owner-local SQLite state — this project's entire point is that captured
# conversations, drafts, and attachment content never leave the owner's
# machine, so these must never be committed, at the repo root or anywhere
# a stray local run happens to have created one.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal

# Internal working docs: phase-by-phase dev logs, research write-ups, the
